rned hairpin I saw in my dream.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["vesti_t"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_72","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_72","text":"\"He even said it looked great on me.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_73","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_73","text":"\"Hearing him say that made me feel like I was on cloud nine.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_74","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_74","text":"\"... It also made me want to become a little more greedy.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_75","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_75","text":"\"I can't quite bring myself to say it out loud yet...\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_76","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_vesti_tactical_05_76","text":"\"but someday, I'll tell the Commander how I really feel!\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}